  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "Margo的艺术作品让卧室和办公室的界限变得模糊。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/be/97/be9705e6fd47835f58e15e72267fcb06.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/be/97/be9705e6fd47835f58e15e72267fcb06.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-quote",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "Margo，艺术家，波兰人",
    "我把自己的作品挂在床头的墙上，这样我的办公室和放松空间之间的界限就变得模糊了"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "为家中的书桌增添个性色彩。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/94/77/947787e497456b10446b92ad805cf333.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/94/77/947787e497456b10446b92ad805cf333.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<h3>将专业和个性相融合</h3><p>利用你最喜欢的盛具存放重要工具，为家庭办公室中注入个性元素。Margo称，“我把这些年收集的花瓶和罐子放在书桌上，让办公室有了家的感觉”。 </p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "选择一把舒适的椅子。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/2c/e3/2ce313970b2bbf23ddc5b29427105329.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/2c/e3/2ce313970b2bbf23ddc5b29427105329.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<h3>选择正确的椅子</h3><p>如果你一整天都要坐在椅子上，&nbsp;那么选择一把支撑性好且时髦的椅子非常重要。&nbsp;“FJÄLLBERGET 菲亚伯 椅子很舒服，和&nbsp;我的卧室装修风格也非常搭，”Margo如是说道。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "充分利用自然光。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/11/38/1138cbcf708af9a77bcaf05e4b272340.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/11/38/1138cbcf708af9a77bcaf05e4b272340.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<h3>风景优美的房间</h3><p>将书桌放在窗户边能够充分利用自然光。添加一盏台灯，为工作提供直射灯光。对于Margo来说，窗外的风景能够给他带来灵感：“我喜欢在工作的时候观察季节变化。”</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "中性色调能够营造静谧的工作空间。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "00250720"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/55/14/55142de22d037dc5aae2fb32bba3b837.jpg"
